OL,3,GNEWSACrews to attend scrapyard blaze
OL,4,Auntil end of week
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews will remain at the scene of
OL,7,Fa scrapyard fire in Barnsley, which
OL,8,Finvolved old buses, until the end of
OL,9,Fthe week, South Yorkshire Fire and
OL,10,FRescue Service (SYFRS) said.
OL,12,FThe blaze, which created huge plumes of
OL,13,Fblack smoke, broke out at Boulder
OL,14,FBridge Lane, Carlton, around 19:00 BST
OL,15,Fon Saturday and at its height required
OL,16,F10 appliances.
OL,18,FThe yard also contains tyres, skips and
OL,19,Fother scrap metal and the cause of the
OL,20,Ffire is still unknown, according to
OL,21,FDavid Newton from SYFRS.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
